<Base title="About" description="Who writes Tangier Insider and how the guides are checked.">
  <h1>About Tangier Insider</h1>
  <p>
    I'm Youssef and I live in Tangier. I started this site because visitors kept asking me the same
    practical questions: which port to use, how much a taxi should cost, which streets to avoid at night,
    and how to say "no thank you" without being rude.
  </p>
  <h2>How the guides are made</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Every page is written or reviewed by someone who lives in Tangier.</li>
    <li>Prices and schedules are checked on official websites or directly at the ticket offices, and each page shows the date of the last check.</li>
    <li>Photos are my own unless a caption says otherwise.</li>
    <li>Some pages may contain affiliate links. If you book through them I may earn a small commission at no extra cost to you. It never changes what I recommend.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Found something outdated? <a href="/contact/">Tell me</a> and I'll fix it.</p>
</Base>
